Third-party software in the published container images
------------------------------------------------------

The container images built from this repository install third-party software
from Debian and Alpine Linux packages. That software is not part of this
product's source code and keeps its own license. Notably:

- AirPlay Video Receiver (airplay_video), built on Debian 13 (trixie):
  - UxPlay (https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay): GPL-3.0-or-later
  - GStreamer and its plugins (https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org): LGPL-2.1-or-later
    (some plugins under other licenses)
  - FFmpeg / libav (through gstreamer1.0-libav): LGPL-2.1-or-later and
    GPL-2.0-or-later parts
  - Avahi (https://avahi.org): LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - D-Bus: AFL-2.1 or GPL-2.0-or-later
  - v4l-utils: GPL-2.0-or-later and LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - curl: curl license; jq: MIT; libdrm tests: MIT
- HDMI-CEC (hdmi_cec), built on Alpine Linux 3.22:
  - Python (https://www.python.org): PSF-2.0

The corresponding source code of each Debian package is available from
https://sources.debian.org and https://snapshot.debian.org for the version
installed in the image (list them with `dpkg-query -W` inside the container).
Alpine package sources are available from https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports.
The license text of each Debian package is in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright
inside the image.
